# Cells for `just matrix scripts/suite/cells/<file>`: one stack per line, the suite runs once per cell (T26-version-matrix).
# name|CLIENT_IMAGE|HOPRD_BIN|CLUSTER_ENV|CLIENT_EXTRA_ENV|LOCALCLUSTER_BIN
#   name              label of the cell (run id suffix, `cell` field in rows/verdicts)
#   CLIENT_IMAGE      client image tag (just build-client)
#   HOPRD_BIN         hoprd binary every cluster node runs; LOCALCLUSTER_BIN from the same tree (empty = the environment's)
#   CLUSTER_ENV       "K=V K=V" for every node, e.g. HOPR_INTERNAL_IN_PACKET_PIPELINE_CONCURRENCY=64 (T25-knob-ab)
#   CLIENT_EXTRA_ENV  "K=V K=V" for the client, e.g. GNOSISVPN_SURB_RAMP_SECS=0
# Empty fields are allowed. Two client builds x two hoprd versions, as an A/B/C/D template:
A-client-latest-hoprd-latest|gnosis_vpn-client:latest|/path/to/hoprd-latest/target/release/hoprd|||/path/to/hoprd-latest/target/release/hoprd-localcluster
B-client-latest-hoprd-prev|gnosis_vpn-client:latest|/path/to/hoprd-prev/target/release/hoprd|||/path/to/hoprd-prev/target/release/hoprd-localcluster
C-client-prev-hoprd-latest|gnosis_vpn-client:prev|/path/to/hoprd-latest/target/release/hoprd|||/path/to/hoprd-latest/target/release/hoprd-localcluster
D-client-prev-hoprd-prev|gnosis_vpn-client:prev|/path/to/hoprd-prev/target/release/hoprd|||/path/to/hoprd-prev/target/release/hoprd-localcluster
